# Torvus Bog ok_swamp_hall layer 3: the two CPlantScarabSwarm placements (e0c2d009a at
# (-177.9,-66.0,-28.3), e0c2d0076 at (-175.9,-36.6,-24.2)).  psc9 keeps the player far away and
# deactivates both swarms right after the load, because phases that leave a swarm without attack
# models or without the shared model must never let a boid take an attack slot.
@f150 god 1
@f200 tp -60.0 -66.0 -28.0
@f220 layer 3
@f260 send e0c2d009a Deactivate; send e0c2d0076 Deactivate
@f600 obj e0c2d009a; obj e0c2d0076
@f1190 obj e0c2d009a; obj e0c2d0076
